    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d431-a1">

                <pb facs="0592" n="486" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg486"/>

                <head>[Inclosure—Translation.]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Executive Offices, Department of
                        Government</hi></placeName>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">Decree No. 383.</seg></opener>
                <p>At the instance of the secretary of public works ad interim of government, I
                    hereby decree the following: <list>
                        <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Article</hi> 1. All campaign operations in
                            the field are hereby suspended, and in consequence thereof the
                            government forces shall place themselves on the defensive throughout the
                            territory of the Republic.</item>
                        <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Art</hi>. 2. The secretary of government
                            is charged with the immediate compliance of this decree, issuing all
                            orders that may be necessary for its execution.</item>
                    </list></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">T. Estrada Palma</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">The President.</hi></signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-09-17"><hi rendition="#italic">September 17,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rafael Montalvo</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Secretary of Public Works, ad interim of Government.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
